    <string name="shared_home_hidden">This installation of Flatdroid didn\'t create %1$s, so files in it from other apps, or from an earlier installation of Flatdroid, are hidden from Flatdroid and its apps.\n\nTo see them, turn on All files access in Settings → Storage. To bring files in, use Import on the home screen. To use another folder, use Change shared home in Settings → Storage.</string>
